	PRINTFORMDW The alarmingly close proximity prompts you to instinctively back up.
	PRINTFORMDL It's impossible not to be drawn to her dark gray eyes, behind long eyelashes.
	PRINTFORMDW You see a mischievous glint in those eyes, but they also give you an impression of deep intelligence.
	PRINTFORMW 「Don't worry, I won't bite～」
	PRINTFORMDL She looks intently at your face, takes your pulse at your wrist, and pokes and prods your body all around.
	PRINTFORMW 「Hmm, looks like you're just fine. The very picture of health, in fact.」
	PRINTFORMDW Giving you her assessment with a smile, she finally lets you go.
	PRINTFORMW 「Now then. At times like this one should begin by introducing oneself.」
	PRINTFORMW 「I am Eirin Yagokoro. I am one of the Princess' attendants. I also work as a doctor and apothecary.」
	PRINTFORMDL She places a hand against her white cheek and shrugs her shoulders slightly.
	PRINTFORMDW You feel that each and every one of those casual gestures belies a formidable opponent.
	PRINTFORMDL You give your name in return, and the woman who calls herself Eirin nods.
	PRINTFORMW 「To think she'd pick up an ordinary human. What a bad habit.」
	PRINTFORMW 「Well, I'll eventually hear all about the circumstances, so for now you should simply rest and take care of your body.」
	PRINTFORMW 「Once you're rested, if you have someplace to stay you can head there. If not, you can remain here for a while.」
	PRINTFORMW 「——Ahh, that's simply how it was relayed to me, so I hope you aren't bothered. Other than that...」
