	PRINTFORMW 「Also, please don't be angry if the mischievous rabbit makes fun of you. That's all I have to say, I think.」
	PRINTFORMW 「In any case, please feel free to relax and enjoy yourself. It should be a good way for that girl to kill time, as well.」
