		PRINTFORMDL As the woman introduces herself, her voice and every mannerism convey a refined impression.
		PRINTFORMDW Clearly, she isn't the sort of person you would expect to be running a pharmacy in a place like this.
		PRINTFORMDL You unintentionally turn a probing gaze on her, but the woman who calls herself Eirin doesn't seem bothered.
		PRINTFORMW 「Still, you're a curious person to move to a dangerous place like this.」
