		PRINTFORMW 「Really? In that case you'll probably run into each other eventually, so please try to get along with her.」
		PRINTFORMDL You readily agree with her. When you nod, she smiles once more.
		PRINTFORMW 「Thank goodness. Well then, pleased to meet you, %CALLNAME:MASTER%.」
		PRINTFORMDL She holds out her hand.
		PRINTFORMDW It's a beautiful hand. As smooth as if it had never seen a single day's work in its life. But the moment you touch her palm——
		PRINTFORML 
		PRINTFORMDW ——Your whole body shudders.
		PRINTFORML 
		PRINTFORMW 「Eientei welcomes you. I wish for us to be good neighbors, forever.」
		PRINTFORML
