@M_KOJO_SPEVENT_K72_1(ARG,ARG:1)
;口上主はTARGET
;地の文表示
;はたて口上を参照
;--------------------------------------------------
;記入チェック（=0, 非表示、1, 表示）
LOCAL = 1
;-------------
IF LOCAL
	IF TALENT:恋慕 || TALENT:思慕
		PRINTFORML 
		PRINTFORMW 「Aha, %CALLNAME:MASTER%. Can you look over here for a moment?」
		PRINTFORMDL She sounds as if she just remembered something, so you turn towards her.
		PRINTFORMDW You find Eirin staring at you intently.
		PRINTFORMDW When you ask her what's the matter, you get no response.
		PRINTFORMDL She's still as calm as ever.
		PRINTFORMDW She stays silent, her gaze almost as though she's observing the subject of an experiment.
		PRINTFORML 
		PRINTFORMDW Ten seconds pass.
		PRINTFORML 
		PRINTFORMDW Then twenty.
		PRINTFORML 
		PRINTFORMDW Then thirty...
		PRINTFORML 
		;一定以上のムードでキス。
		IF BASE:ムード >= 500
			PRINTFORMDW Concluding that she must be teasing you, you open your mouth to complain. Just at that moment...
			PRINTFORML
			PRINTFORMW 「Mmm――――」
			PRINTFORML 
			PRINTFORMDW You find your lips suddenly stolen away, as if she was waiting for just such an opening.
			PRINTFORML 
			PRINTFORMDW Then, once more...
			PRINTFORML 
			PRINTFORMDW Ten seconds pass.
			PRINTFORML 
			PRINTFORMDW And twenty.
			PRINTFORML 
			PRINTFORMDW And thirty.
			PRINTFORML 
			PRINTFORMDW After exactly the same passage of time, Eirin slowly releases your lips.
			PRINTFORML 
			PRINTFORMW 「...Mm. Thanks for the meal.」
			PRINTFORMW 「Such a wonderful feeling. All through it, and even before.」
			PRINTFORML 
			PRINTFORMDW On the surface her usual attitude remains completely unchanged, but somehow she seems to be having a tremendous amount of fun.
			PRINTFORMDW Her cheeks flush faintly, and her moist eyes reflect her inner feelings, shimmering feverishly.
			PRINTFORMW 
		;ムードが半分未満でキスせず。
		ELSE
			TCVAR:キスキャンセル = 1
			PRINTFORMDW You start to wonder if she's teasing you, and you open your mouth to complain.
			PRINTFORML 
			PRINTFORMDL But at that moment...
			PRINTFORMDW Extending her index finger, she places it against your lips to halt them in their tracks.
